  "details": "So, for example; \nLet's say you are sketching out a system in udon, and you want to test something real quick, wouldnt it be nicer to have on key down as an UdonEvent with Parameters? (Instead of making an IF Statement on FixedUpdate and so forth)\nWould make debugging and testing faster\nAlso, happy holidays!\n",
